# Review — DaoStream v2 implementation (staged changes)

**Scope:** the 8 staged files, checked against `AGENTS.md`, `docs/design/datom.world.md`, `docs/design/dao.stream.md` (the contract), `docs/design/dao.stream.implementation-plan.md` (the plan), `docs/design/dao.stream.ws.md`.

**Note on review conditions:** all 8 files were reformatted and re-staged mid-review (mtimes 17:20:44–45). All findings below were verified against the final staged content (index == worktree at time of writing).

